      },
      {
        "answer": "No, it isn't deleted yet.  This card's [On Play] [When Digivolving] effect activates \"・1 of your opponent's Digimon gets -2000 DP for the turn\" 4 times, then all Digimon with 0 DP are deleted at the same timing.",
